    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9751cabb21968ef544a33285",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想要的是跟风一样轻盈，又可以轻易弯曲，\n但又拥有跟大地一样的包覆力……充满热情的运动鞋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d2c7677c6c14c95716957fb8c95adf64d202b5ac3abff0554c40a2be3855df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
