      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我依照她的指示，试着询问店员有没有具备抓地力和避震性……\n而且穿起来很透气，颜色明亮的鞋子后——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0c4db033a8279bd853d27bce9c783f80e803bd42d97ddd20c0acc79431e5af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
