      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "简直就像是我和妈妈携手一起奔跑。\n没错，那时我和妈妈一起去买庆祝用的礼物——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f157b1f0a2c3b7ed035fd6f064e835e70cb8c8834a44b2d02a37e0faac8412d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
